HM3D-M3 (HM3D-M³): A Benchmark for Multi-Agent, Multi-Modal, Multi-Object Goal Navigation
Copyright (c) 2026 HM3D-M3 authors

This file is the single license file of this repository. It has five parts:

  Part 1  Code: Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0)
  Part 2  Data (distributed separately): CC BY-NC 4.0 plus the HM3D / Matterport terms
