  Part 4  Full text of CC BY-NC-SA 4.0
  Part 5  Full texts of the third-party licenses referenced in Part 3

========================================================================
Part 1. Code
========================================================================

Except where Part 3 says otherwise, the code and documentation in this
repository are licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International Public License
(CC BY-NC-SA 4.0), whose full text is in Part 4 and at
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/legalcode.

You may use, share and adapt this code for non-commercial purposes only,
with attribution, and you must distribute adaptations under the same license.
For commercial use, contact the authors.

Third-party code in this repository, or fetched by its setup scripts, keeps
its own license and copyright notices (Part 3). CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 applies only
to the contributions of the HM3D-M3 authors. In particular:
  - files that keep an upstream copyright header remain under that upstream
    license for the upstream portions;
  - vendored components under real-world-code/native/ keep the LICENSE file next to
    their code;
  - the patches in real-world-code/native/patches/ modify GPL code and are distributed
    under the corresponding GPL (FAST-LIO: GPL-2.0, EGO-Planner v2: GPL-3.0);
  - SuperGlue is never fetched automatically or redistributed; it is subject
    to the Magic Leap non-commercial research license.

========================================================================
Part 2. Data
========================================================================

The HM3D-M3 data packages are distributed outside this code repository
(GitHub release: https://github.com/NJU-R-L-Group-Embodied-Lab/hm3d-m3-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0; Hugging Face dataset: https://huggingface.co/datasets/skyhyding/HM3D-M3).

2.1 HM3D-M3 annotations: CC BY-NC 4.0.
    Episode files (Val, Mini-100, Train): agent start poses, goal sets, goal
    modalities, text goal descriptions, viewpoints and oracle makespans;
    manifests and index files; and the 100K observation-assignment teacher
    samples are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial
    4.0 International License (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/),
    Copyright (c) 2026 HM3D-M3 authors.

2.2 HM3D / Matterport terms are required.
    All episodes refer to scenes of the Habitat-Matterport 3D (HM3D) dataset
    (https://aihabitat.org/datasets/hm3d/). The scenes are not distributed by
    us. To use the data you must obtain HM3D yourself and accept the Matterport
    End User License Agreement for Academic Use under which HM3D is distributed.

2.3 Rendered images are derived from HM3D.
    Instance-image goal images and any image tensors in the teacher samples
    are renderings of HM3D scenes. Using or redistributing them is subject to
    the HM3D / Matterport terms in addition to CC BY-NC 4.0. Do not use them
    for commercial purposes.

2.4 Other sources.
    Open-vocabulary goal categories follow the OVON vocabulary
    (https://github.com/naokiyokoyama/ovon). Text goal descriptions were
    generated with a hosted VLM (Qwen3.5-27B) from rendered views.

2.5 The data is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind.

