### 3.5 Real-robot code (`real-world-code/`)

The Python package `real-world-code/src/lavira_m3` is HM3D-M3 code (Part 1).
Native components keep their own licenses (texts next to each component); see
[`real-world-code/native/THIRD_PARTY.md`](real-world-code/native/THIRD_PARTY.md) for the pinned
revisions and our modifications. The GPL components (FAST-LIO, EGO-Planner v2)
are **not vendored**: `real-world-code/native/fetch_native.sh` clones them at the pinned
commits and applies `real-world-code/native/patches/`. Those patches modify GPL code and are
distributed under the respective upstream GPL license (FAST-LIO: GPL-2.0,
EGO-Planner v2: GPL-3.0); see
[`real-world-code/native/patches/README.md`](real-world-code/native/patches/README.md).

| Component | Location | Upstream (commit checked) | License |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| FAST-LIO (incl. ikd-Tree, IKFoM) | fetched into `real-world-code/native/*/src/localization/FAST_LIO/`; patches in `real-world-code/native/patches/fast_lio/` | https://github.com/hku-mars/FAST_LIO (ROS 1 and shared headers: `main` @ `7cc4175de6f8ba2edf34bab02a42195b141027e9`; ROS 2: `ROS2` @ `87c42cdb8f2c569c27d95920ea6c733cffb3eba8`); ikd-Tree https://github.com/hku-mars/ikd-Tree @ `e2e3f4e9d3b95a9e66b1ba83dc98d4a05ed8a3c4` | **GPL-2.0** (patches too) |
